msgstr "Feu clic a <emph>Aplica-ho a tot</emph>."

#. UYFn6
#: printing.xhp
msgctxt ""
"printing.xhp\n"
"par_id863063\n"
"help.text"
msgid "The fields in the master handout view on screen are not updated, but the text that you entered will be printed."
msgstr "Els camps de la vista del prospecte mestre a la pantalla no s'actualitzen, però el text que hàgiu introduït s'imprimirà."

#. YHUmc
#: printing.xhp
msgctxt ""
